-- The profile every new install starts from: Jiberish's own setup, exported
-- from the Profiles page (SPEC01 format, checksummed). Applied once, on a
-- character with no saved settings; frame positions are left out so the
-- layout it names is solved for the new player's own screen. It was made at a
-- UI scale of 0.64, which a new install starts at too (UI.DEFAULT_SCALE), and
-- its positions are the 'main' layout, solved for the new screen (UI.DEFAULT_LAYOUT).
local _, UI = ...
UI.DEFAULT_SCALE = 0.64
UI.DEFAULT_LAYOUT = 'main'
UI.DEFAULT_PROFILE = 'SPEC01:1:fc55757e:'

-- The Blizzard Edit Mode layout that goes with it, exported from Edit Mode on
-- Forever. It is imported through C_EditMode (never Blizzard's own frames, so
-- nothing of theirs is tainted) as an account layout and made active: on a new
